   :

    VERSION 1.00 -> 1.20:

    * Major buffer overflow bug repaired.
    * Allows EALLS regarding the files to be made.  A message
      with the files and their descriptions, plus an optional
      one-line message may be sent.
    * Now accepts arguments. (eg, "COUP foo.lha bar.dms").
    * Multiple FREEDLTEXT's may be set, for the user to choose from.
    * Added quick user docs ("COUP ?")
    * Will now search ALL upload dirs for physical files.
    * Design alterations                                                     :
